NNAAMMEE
     yyppmmaattcchh — print the values of one or more keys in a NIS database

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     yyppmmaattcchh [--kktt] [--dd _d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e] _k_e_y _._._. _m_a_p_n_a_m_e
     yyppmmaattcchh --xx

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The yyppmmaattcchh utility prints out the values of one or more keys from the
     NIS database specified by _m_a_p_n_a_m_e, which may be a map name or a map nick‐
     name.

     The options are as follows:

     --dd _d_o_m_a_i_n_n_a_m_e
             Specify a domain other than the default domain.

     --kk      Display map keys.  This option is useful with maps in which the
             values are null or the key is not part of the value.

     --tt      Inhibit translation of map nicknames to their corresponding map
             names.

     --xx      Display the map nickname table.

